initial_milestones.description:
Initial milestones to create (REQUIRED if use_milestones=true). Define the phases/stages of your project. Each milestone contains tasks, and tasks can have subtasks.

💡 PLANNING TIP:
Break your project into 3-5 major phases. Each phase should have a clear deliverable.

Example structure:
[
  {
    milestone_name: 'Phase 1: Setup',
    description: 'Create and configure database',
    tasks: [
      'Create Google Sheet',
      {
        task: 'Design schema',
        subtasks: ['Define fields', 'Set validation', 'Add formulas']
      }
    ],
    priority: 'critical',
    due_date: '2025-12-01',
    estimated_hours: 8
  },
  {
    milestone_name: 'Phase 2: Integration',
    tasks: ['Create form', 'Connect to sheet', 'Test workflow']
  }
]
